</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The need is deep, the care is great,</l><l>The burden hard to bear;</l><l>Roll it on Him with all its weight,</l><l>And leave it resting there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This heavy thing, it is His gift,</l><l>His portion, thee to bless;</l><l>Give it Him back; what He shall lift</l><l>No more on thee shall press.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Cast all thy care, and not a part,</l><l>The great things and the small;</l><l>The Lord’s all-loving, mighty heart</l><l>Has room and thought for all.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Yes, He will ponder every care,</l><l>Consider each detail;</l><l>Thyself, thy burden, let Him bear;</l><l>He will not, cannot, fail.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
